{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>北角懷疑有人遇溺。今日（17日）早上6時許，警方接獲途人報案稱，見到有人在北角匯對開海面飄浮，懷疑遇溺。消防船接報到場，在離岸約20米位置將一名中年女子救起。她昏迷不醒，被送上岸後送到東區醫院，其間救護員用自動心外壓機為她急救。</p><figure><img alt=\"事主由救護車送院，其間要用自動心外壓機急救。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260717/1154689009100787712865049.jpeg/_MVe5pIRoNbSYGzRrTe0CbNQxkzKilE_fh5rjX4ea40\"/><figcaption>事主由救護車送院，其間要用自動心外壓機急救。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"事主由救護車送院，其間要用自動心外壓機急救。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260717/1154689013135839232107649.jpeg/vnWhEqPNcY_X1OVUKUaAvK6UGgZkHBcaTIkb6EyJG-g\"/><figcaption>事主由救護車送院，其間要用自動心外壓機急救。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"事主由救護車送院，其間要用自動心外壓機急救。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260717/1154689017183473664380791.jpeg/jZ1aATE6Kvm8DzC3ySLAu8Th4_tBlk-20HV59NB1efQ\"/><figcaption>事主由救護車送院，其間要用自動心外壓機急救。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"男子在北角匯對開海面墮海。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260717/1154686719493148672249781.jpeg/1UdXdeQKeSNJOK3tsszOMQAHAeDCVUwT1pvDvNabw7w\"/><figcaption>男子在北角匯對開海面墮海。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"男子在北角匯對開墮海獲救送院。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260717/1154687207785631744246071.jpeg/bbKU4gqZMQvL4-Dd_T_BFQdrAPZK4AlNOuHckjrh3JI\"/><figcaption>男子在北角匯對開墮海獲救送院。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"男子在北角匯對開墮海獲救送院。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260717/1154687211581607936732649.jpeg/enHJRhOfvGgHpFCnZ1gOvejIcC8o_L9hcRQbGnEUGxo\"/><figcaption>男子在北角匯對開墮海獲救送院。</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-17T00:39:38.479956+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":229,"images":6,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}